# Prime Bazaar – Final Marketplace Requirements & Implementation Blueprint



Configuration finalized

India marketplace



Your selected configuration is for a complete Indian multi-vendor e-commerce marketplace, similar in functionality to Amazon, Meesho and Myntra.

Prime Bazaar will support individual sellers, registered businesses, integrated shipping, product video shopping, individual seller stores, live shopping, buyer–seller chat, coupons and loyalty rewards.

The system will have three connected portals:

1. Buyer website and account.
2. Seller registration and dashboard.
3. Admin dashboard and marketplace control.

