| `coupon_usages`        | id, coupon_id, buyer_id, order_id                             |
| `loyalty_accounts`     | id, buyer_id, points_balance                                  |
| `loyalty_transactions` | id, buyer_id, points, transaction_type, reference_id          |
| `referral_codes`       | id, user_id, referral_code                                    |
| `referral_rewards`     | id, referrer_id, referred_id, reward_status                   |

## H. Video, live shopping and chat database

| Table                   | Main columns                                             |
| ----------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------- |
| `live_sessions`         | id, seller_id, title, stream_provider, stream_id, status |
| `live_session_products` | id, session_id, product_id                               |
| `live_viewers`          | id, session_id, buyer_id, joined_at                      |
| `chat_conversations`    | id, buyer_id, seller_id, order_id                        |
| `chat_participants`     | id, conversation_id, user_id                             |
| `chat_messages`         | id, conversation_id, sender_id, message, message_type    |
| `chat_attachments`      | id, message_id, file_url                                 |
| `notifications`         | id, user_id, type, message, read_at                      |

## I. Administration database

| Table                    | Main columns                                |
| ------------------------ | ------------------------------------------- |
| `admin_users`            | id, user_id, department                     |
| `admin_permissions`      | id, permission_name                         |
| `admin_role_permissions` | role_id, permission_id                      |
| `audit_logs`             | id, user_id, action, entity_type, entity_id |
| `support_tickets`        | id, user_id, subject, status                |
| `support_messages`       | id, ticket_id, sender_id, message           |
| `platform_settings`      | id, setting_key, setting_value              |
| `banners`                | id, title, image_url, start_date, end_date  |

