These services will connect Prime Bazaar with external providers.

| Requirement          | Recommended provider     | Purpose                        |
| -------------------- | ------------------------ | ------------------------------ |
| Payment gateway      | Razorpay                 | UPI, cards, net banking        |
| Alternative payments | Cashfree Payments        | Payment collection and payouts |
| Shipping             | Shiprocket               | Courier aggregation            |
| Shipping alternative | Delhivery                | Courier delivery               |
| SMS OTP              | MSG91                    | Mobile verification            |
| Email                | Brevo                    | Emails and notifications       |
| Push notifications   | Firebase Cloud Messaging | App and browser notifications  |
| Maps                 | Google Maps Platform     | Address and location           |
| Live streaming       | Agora                    | Live video shopping            |
| Real-time messaging  | Socket.IO                | Buyer–seller chat              |
| Product storage      | Amazon S3                | Images and video storage       |

Provider onboarding, commercial terms, API credentials and marketplace payout eligibility must be verified before production integration.

Important: Use a payment gateway's approved marketplace/split-settlement arrangement for seller payouts. Do not collect customer money into an ordinary personal bank account and manually distribute it without an appropriate legal and payment structure.

